<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MONDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Monday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,556.20 (1,560.90)	CHF  1,059.40 (1,062.70)</p>
<p>    DEM    902.93 (910.15)	  GBP  2,529.10 (2,529.40)</p>
<p>    ATS    128.33 (129.34)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $22.16 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $36.57 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $58.73 million ($41.53 million) -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
</text>
